:R-HSA-73863  a             owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0006363 ;
        rdfs:comment        "Termination of transcription by RNA polymerase I is a 4 step process. Initially TTF-1 binds the template rDNA. This complex pauses polymerase I allowing PTRF to interact with the quaternary complex releasing both pre-rRNA and Pol I from the template and TTF-1." ;
        rdfs:label          "RNA Polymerase I Transcription Termination" ;
        dc:contributor      "Authored: Comai, L, 2003-07-03 17:28:24" , "Edited: Gillespie, ME, 0000-00-00 00:00:00" , "GOC:reactome_curators" ;
